0..59 Comment "//! `Generated` and `Wider` state extension signatures over"
60..85 Comment "//! finite face theories."
86..89 Comment "//!"
90..163 Comment "//! The signatures show the behaviour of `ext` over two and three points."
164..167 Comment "//!"
168..243 Comment "//! The checker derives each boundary, β and η law from its `ext` member."
244..247 Comment "//!"
248..263 Comment "//! - see: #641"
264..335 Comment "//! - cites: [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]"
336..339 Comment "//!"
340..495 Comment "//! [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.05658 \"Zhang, Three non-cubical applications of extension types\""
496..499 Comment "//!"
